# Real attributedBody typedstream blob (NSMutableAttributedString archive) from a
# macOS 27.0 chat.db row that carried text plus one image attachment. The 101-byte
# UTF-8 payload keeps Apple's leading U+FFFC attachment placeholder (EF BF BC) and
# has its remaining 98 bytes replaced with a same-length neutral sentence for
# privacy; every structural byte is as Apple wrote it.
# Expected decoded payload: U+FFFC followed by: fixture probe 2026: this sentence stands in for a real text that had a photo attached to it!......

